    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54877" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάπον-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tired, wearied</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθλητής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; <i>worn out, exhausted</i>, of cattle, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1170v462
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>laboured</i>, of poetry or works of art, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; <i>wearisome</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ma.</u>
					4.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βάρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
